1mNetworking stack (task 12):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m WinINet only — single static import\u001b[93m InternetSetOptionA\u001b[97m (called 0x14000b43a); everything\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[97melse resolved at runtime by FUN_14003c2ac @ 0x14003c2ac via\u001b[93m GetProcAddress(LoadLibraryA(\"wininet.dll\"))\u001b[97m with plaintext\r\nnames: InternetOpenW, InternetConnectW, HttpOpenRequestW, HttpSendRequestW, InternetReadFile, InternetOpenUrlA,\u001b[39m      \r\n\u001b[97mInternetCloseHandle. Core HTTP functions:\u001b[93m c2_http_post_json\u001b[97m @ 0x14000b384 (POST engine) and\u001b[93m http_download_url_to_file\u001b[97m @\r\n0x14000b1e0 (InternetOpenUrlA downloader). No WinHTTP, no winsock.\u001b[6C\u001b[39m            \u001b[3C        \u001b[14C        \r\n                            \u001b[C  \u001b[41C            \u001b[3C           \u001b[11C        \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mC2 endpoint (task 13):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m http://45.93.20.28/3d15e67552d448ff.php\u001b[97m — port 80, plain HTTP. The detector's \"URI path\"\u001b[39m      \r\n\u001b[93m/x6mNTpQ8CGGjZQ=\u001b[97m @ 0x14007d838 is actually the RC4-encrypted\u001b[1m host\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (base64→RC4 key\u001b[93m \"CgeOvEO7hu\"\u001b[97m →\u001b[93m 45.93.20.28\u001b[97m, stored in\r\nDAT_1400b0490 and passed to InternetConnectW); the real path decrypts from the adjacent token to\u001b[93m /3d15e67552d448ff.php\r\n\u001b[97m(DAT_1400b0630). Verified independently with the native decode pipeline, matching the other agent's finding (!56).\u001b[39m   \r\n                            \u001b[44C            \u001b[3C           \u001b[11C        \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mMessage format (task 14):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m Beacon\u001b[93m c2_beacon_and_dispatch_tasks\u001b[97m @ 0x140029900 (contains nlohmann-json asserts citing\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93mC:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h\u001b[97m — direct Stealc v2 builder evidence) builds\u001b[93m {\"type\":\"loginr\",\"access_token\":...}\u001b[97